# FOLD and the room share a physical volume; green growth, cyan sound, amber speakers.
# X width / Y height / Z depth, in metres, centered at the room origin.
# Without an explicit p, growth occupies the room in XYZ. @ still routes sound parameters.
# !vp = parameter cube. !vs = room + organism + trajectories. !vd is reserved.
!t[Biome in a room]
!room[20 8 30]
spkOCT
!vs
G234@fov (s165v1e0254'0.5)
H232@fov (t220v0.7e0254'0.7)
S223@fov (n2v0.15e0254'0.4f5)
